00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,600
Paint the sockets in the wall, dull green.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,680
The child crawled into the dense grass,

3
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:12,080
bribes fail where honest men work.

4
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:16,240
Trampal the spark, else the flames will spread.

5
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:21,640
The hilt of the sword was carved with fine designs.

6
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:26,520
A round hole was drilled through the thin board.

7
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:30,480
Footprints showed the path he took up the beach.

8
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:34,760
She was waiting at my front lawn.

9
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:38,000
Event near the edge brought in fresh air.

10
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,200
Proud the old mule with a crooked stick.
